Description  "Jedi Sage

A glass cannon duelist and Force user with exceptional offensive and evasive skills.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster rate of fire
- Lightsaber (Red)
-- Saber Defense (3)
--- BP-Free Jumps
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- 25% more special damage
-- 30% shorter
-- 26% thinner
-- EX Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage
- Force Lift (Minigun 3)
-- Lifts on hit
-- Hitscan power
-- 100% less damage

^5Force Powers:
- Push (2)
- Pull (3)
- Sense (3)
- Absorb (1) ^3[CS2]
- Protect (1) ^3[CS4]
- Speed (2) ^3[CS3]
-- Speedlunge

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Dexterity (3)
- Healing (1)
- Aerial Force Regen
- Force Block (3)
- Force Focus (2)

^3Abilities:
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]"